{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cannonball_stack","model_identifier":"cannonball_stack","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## cannonball_stack\n\nAmmunition stack.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.5..3.5, y 0.0..6.0, z -3.5..3.5 (size 7.0 x 6.0 x 7.0 u = 20 x 17 x 20 cm).\nCannonball stack: a small pyramid of 10 cm (3.5 u) balls, 4 on the ground and 1 on top; each ball is two crossed cubes so it reads round. Stands on the ground at y = 0. Textures: iron (default, dark) and `cannonball_stack_stone.png`.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `cannonball_stack_iron.png`, `cannonball_stack_stone.png`\n"},"description":"## cannonball_stack\n\nAmmunition stack.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.5..3.5, y 0.0..6.0, z -3.5..3.5 (size 7.0 x 6.0 x 7.0 u = 20 x 17 x 20 cm).\nCannonball stack: a small pyramid of 10 cm (3.5 u) balls, 4 on the ground and 1 on top; each ball is two crossed cubes so it reads round. Stands on the ground at y = 0. Textures: iron (default, dark) and `cannonball_stack_stone.png`.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `cannonball_stack_iron.png`, `cannonball_stack_stone.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"ball_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,0.6,-3.5],"to":[0.0,2.9,0.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6,12,9.5,14.3],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10,12,13.5,14.3],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14,12,17.5,14.3],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,12,21.5,14.3],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,3.5,3.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[4,0,7.5,3.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"54d9848c-c4ad-5ab6-9151-e4762d1ad0ce"},{"na